["<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">然</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>那样；如此；既然如此；那么；（表示状态）样子</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ゼン・ネン</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">しか・しか.り・しか.し・さ</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">偶然</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ぐうぜん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">巧合；偶然；意外；偶然性；偶然地；出乎意料地；无意中；（哲学）偶然性（与必然性相对）</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">自然</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">しぜん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">自然；自然的；自发的；自动的；自然地；自发地；自动地</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">天然</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">てんねん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">自然；天然性；天然呆</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">限</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>限制；限度；限于；极限；尽量</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ゲン</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">かぎ.る・かぎ.り・-かぎ.り</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">限る</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">かぎる</span><span class=\"k-wz\">限制；限定；局限；仅限于；只限于；局限于；最好是；最佳选择；唯一途径</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">限界</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">げんかい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">极限；界限；限度</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">制限</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">せいげん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">限制；约束；限定</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">追</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>追赶；追求；驱赶；补充；随后</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ツイ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">お.う</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">追う</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">おう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">追赶；追逐；追捕；跟随；遵循；顺应；跟随；驱赶；赶出；驱逐；驱赶（牲畜等）；（用被动形）被（时间等）逼迫；疲于应付</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">追い付く</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">おいつく</span><span class=\"k-wz\">赶上；跟上；与…并驾齐驱；到达；得到补偿；弥补损失</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">追加</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ついか</span><span class=\"k-wz\">添加；补充；附加；附录</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">商</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>买卖；经商；商人</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ショウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">あきな.う</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">商人</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">しょうにん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">商人；商贩；店主；经营者</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">商売</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">しょうばい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">贸易；商业；买卖；职业；行业；工作</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">商品</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">しょうひん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">商品；货物；商品物资；库存品；商业物品</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">葉</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>叶子；薄片状物；叶片；针叶；碎片</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ヨウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\