式；外表；表面上的样子；状态；局面；情况；形式；态度；举止；待人方式；礼仪；（围棋）棋形</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">人形</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">にんぎょう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">玩偶；木偶；提线木偶；傀儡；傀儡人物</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">形式</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">けいしき</span><span class=\"k-wz\">形式（相对于实质）；格式；形式；风格；方式；形式；礼节；（哲学）样态；形式；型（双线性型、二次型等）</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">景</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>风景；景色；景观</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ケイ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\"></dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">景色</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">けしき</span><span class=\"k-wz\">景色；风景；景观</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">景気</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">けいき</span><span class=\"k-wz\">经济形势；市场；经济活动；经济气候；经济繁荣；景气；繁华；兴旺；生气；活力；朝气；精力</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">光景</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">こうけい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">景象；景色；光景；景观</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">落</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>落下；掉落；降低；村落</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ラク</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">お.ちる・お.ち・お.とす</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">落す</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">おとす</span><span class=\"k-wz\">掉落；遗失；放下；投射；倒入；留下；擦净；去除（污垢、妆容等）；失去；（在某处）花钱；省略；遗漏；暗中放走；输掉（比赛）；淘汰（应试者）；使不及格；（选举中）击败对手；降低；减少；恶化；贬低；看不起；陷入困境；陷入（困境、罪孽）；据为己有；中标；迫使投降；攻陷（敌阵、城池）；强行说服；逼供；处理；下载；复制；使其失去意识（柔道）；讲完；说出关键部分；结束（斋戒等一段时期）；赢得；引诱；克服</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">落ちる</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">おちる</span><span class=\"k-wz\">落下；坠落；下降；倒塌；塌陷；崩塌；（日月）西沉；落下；下沉；（知名度、质量、速度、销售等）下降；衰落；下跌；衰退；恶化；减弱；不如；不及；逊于；差于；（污垢、油漆、妆等）脱落；（污渍）消除；（颜色）褪去；（疾病、附身等）消除；（多余脂肪）减掉；变瘦；变精瘦；遗漏；省略；缺失；（考试）不及格；（竞赛、选举等）落选；失败；（道德、品格等）堕落；变得低俗；沦落；堕入；没落；垮掉；毁灭；堕入（地狱）；陷入（爱河、睡眠等）；落入（某人手中）；（出价）被接受；（招标）中标；（汇票）被兑现；落入（陷阱）；上（当）；屈服；让步；认罪；招供；坦白；（最终）归结到（结论、话题等）；落在……上；弃守；逃离（城镇、城堡等）；战败逃亡；（话）听进去；心里接受；领会；陷落；战败；（金钱）进账；（光线、影子、目光等）落在……上；照到；投在；（柔道）被绞昏；失去知觉；昏迷；（网站、服务器等）宕机；崩溃；（网络游戏、聊天室等）登出；退出；离线；（鱼在冬天）游向深水；（动物）死亡；（闪电）击中</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">洒落</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">しゃらく</span><span class=\"k-wz\">洒脱；开朗；坦率；不拘束；随和</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">好</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>喜欢；爱好；良好；合适</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">コウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">この.む・す.く・よ.い・い.い</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">好き</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">すき</span><span class=\"k-wz\">喜欢</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">大好き</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">だいすき</span><span class=\"k-wz\">非常喜欢；热爱；很喜欢；非常爱好</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">好み</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">このみ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">喜好；爱好；品味；偏好；心愿；愿望；选择；偏好</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">退</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>后退；撤退；退出；辞去；排斥</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">タイ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">しりぞ.く・しりぞ.ける・ひ.く・の.く・の.ける・ど.く</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">退院</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">たいいん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">出院</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">引退</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">いんたい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">退休；隐退；退出</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">退屈</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">たいくつ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">乏味；无聊；沉闷；单调；令人厌烦；感到厌倦；厌烦；厌倦</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">頭</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>头；头部；（动物）头数；首领；顶端</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">トウ・ズ・ト</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">あたま・かしら・-がしら・かぶり</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">頭</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">あたま</span><span class=\"k-wz\">头；头部；头发；头脑；思维；智力；领导；首领；头目；队长；顶端；顶部；尖端；开始；起始；人头；人；首付；预付款；定金；汉字的上部部件；（麻将）雀头；将牌</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">頭痛</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ずつう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">头痛</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">頭脳</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ずのう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">头脑；大脑；智力；理解力；聪慧</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">負</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>败；负（承担）；欠（债）；负（责任）；减（负数）</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">フ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ま.ける・ま.かす・お.う</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">負ける</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">まける</span><span class=\"k-wz\">失败；被击