n></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">失業</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">しつぎょう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">失业；失业；失去工作</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">差</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>差异；差距；插入；撑（伞）；照射</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">サ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">さ.す・さ.し</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">差す</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">さす</span><span class=\"k-wz\">照射；闪耀；显现；露出；泛着；染上；上涨；流入；油然而生；涌上心头；撑起；举起；（舞蹈）向前伸直手臂；插入；置入；佩刀于腰间；挟于腋下携带；（相扑）将手臂插入对方腋下；撑船；撑篙；倾注；添加；斟（酒）；涂抹；上色；染色；点燃；烧起；关闭；锁上；栓好；中断；搁置</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">交差点</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">こうさてん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">十字路口；交叉口</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">差し上げる</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">さしあげる</span><span class=\"k-wz\">抬起；举起；提起；赠送；奉献；呈上；为（某人）做</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">末</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>末尾；末端；粉末；子孙；结束</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">マツ・バツ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">すえ・うら・うれ</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">末</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">うら</span><span class=\"k-wz\">顶端；尖端</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">粗末</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">そまつ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">粗糙；粗陋；朴素；简陋；破旧；劣质；低劣</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">月末</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">げつまつ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">月末；月终</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">守</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>守护；保护；防卫；遵守</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">シュ・ス</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">まも.る・まも.り・もり・-もり・かみ</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">留守</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">るす</span><span class=\"k-wz\">不在家；外出；离家；看家；看家人；荒废；疏于看管；怠忽</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">守る</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">まもる</span><span class=\"k-wz\">保护；守卫；防守；遵守；履行；遵循；服从；遵从</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">留守番</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">るすばん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">看家；守家；在家看守；看家人；守家人</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">若</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>年轻；若；如果；或许；低数量</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ジャク・ニャク・ニャ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">わか.い・わか-・も.しくわ・も.し・も.しくは・ごと.し</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">若い</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">わかい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">年轻的；年少的；不成熟的；青涩的；小的；低的（数字）</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">若々しい</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">わかわかしい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">年轻的；年轻的外表；充满朝气的</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">若干</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">じゃっかん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">若干；少许；一些；少量；略微；在某种程度上；有点</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">種</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/kanji/\">N3