\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">いのち</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">一生懸命</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">いっしょうけんめい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">拼命；竭尽全力；全力以赴；不遗余力；急切地；拼死地</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">命</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">いのち</span><span class=\"k-wz\">生命；生命力；一生；寿命；最重要的东西；基础；核心；（男女上臂的）命字纹身（象征坚贞的爱情）；命运；宿命；因果</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">生命</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">せいめい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">生命；存在；（一生的）工作经历；职业生涯；生命力；精髓；灵魂；本质</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">福</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>福气；幸运；财富；好运</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">フク</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\"></dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">幸福</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">こうふく</span><span class=\"k-wz\">幸福；福祉；快乐；安康；幸福感</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">福</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ふく</span><span class=\"k-wz\">福运；幸福；祝福；好运</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">福祉</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ふくし</span><span class=\"k-wz\">福利；福祉；社会福利；社会保障；社会服务</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">望</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>希望；愿望；渴望；满月；仰望</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ボウ・モウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">のぞ.む・もち</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">希望</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">きぼう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">希望；愿望；抱负；（光明的）