ef=\"../../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>横向；侧面；宽度；横（无理）；横（歪斜）</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">オウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">よこ</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">横</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">よこ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">横向；水平；左右；宽度；广度；侧面；边；旁边；身旁；近处；无关；不相干</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">横断</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">おうだん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">横穿；穿过；横贯；相交；横断；横越；横渡；飞越；航越；横截；横切；横向切断</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">横切る</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">よこぎる</span><span class=\"k-wz\">横切；横穿；穿过</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">深</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>深；加深；变深；深度</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">シン</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ふか.い・-ぶか.い・ふか.まる・ふか.める・み-</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">深い</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ふかい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">深；深刻；深远；浓密；厚重；亲密；密切；强烈；浓厚；深；晚</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">深刻</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">しんこく</span><span class=\"k-wz\">严重；严肃</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">深夜</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">しんや</span><span class=\"k-wz\">深夜；午夜</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">申</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>申述；申（地支第九位）；申时（下午3-5点）；猴（生肖第九位）</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">シン</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">もう.す・もう.し-・さる</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">申す</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">もうす</span><span class=\"k-wz\">说；称为；做；进行</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">申し上げる</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">もうしあげる</span><span class=\"k-wz\">说；告诉；陈述；表达；献（祝贺等）；做</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">申し訳</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">もうしわけ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">道歉；借口；托词</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">様</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>样子；方式；状态；类似；敬称（接人名后）</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ヨウ・ショウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">さま・さん</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">様</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">さま</span><span class=\"k-wz\">先生；太太；小姐；女士；使词语更加礼貌（常用于固定表达）；状态；情形；外观；样子</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">王様</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">おうさま</span><span class=\"k-wz\">王；国王</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">様々</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">さまざま</span><span class=\"k-wz\">各种各样；五花八门；形形色色</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">財</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>财产；财富；金钱；资产</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ザイ・サイ・ゾク</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">たから</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">財布</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">さいふ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">钱包；皮夹；零钱包</span></l