"n3\" href=\"../../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>呼叫；呼吸；邀请；召唤；称呼</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">コ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">よ.ぶ</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">呼ぶ</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">よぶ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">呼叫；呼唤；唤起；召唤（医生等）；邀请；称为；命名；称呼；博得（支持等）；聚集；娶为妻子；迎娶</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">呼吸</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">こきゅう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">呼吸；呼吸作用；窍门；诀窍；秘诀；和谐；协调；同步；配合；短暂间隔；短暂停顿</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">呼び出す</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">よびだす</span><span class=\"k-wz\">叫来；传唤；召唤；打电话叫；呼叫（如呼叫服务）；唤起（如唤起精灵）；调用；打开；启动</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">達</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>达到；到达；完成；达成</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">タツ・ダ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">-たち</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">友達</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ともだち</span><span class=\"k-wz\">朋友</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">上達</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">じょうたつ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">进步；提高；进展；上达；下情上达</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">配達</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">はいたつ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">配送；递送；投递</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">良</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>良好；擅长；令人满意</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">リョウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">よ.い・-よ.い・い.い・-い.い</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">仲良し</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">なかよし</span><span class=\"k-wz\">亲密的友谊；亲密的朋友；好友；知心伙伴；老友；亲密关系；性交；做爱</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">改良</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">かいりょう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">改良；改进；改革</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">善良</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ぜんりょう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">善良；心地好；有德行；诚实</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">候</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>气候；季节；天气；等待；期望</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">コウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">そうろう</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">気候</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">きこう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">气候</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">候補</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">こうほ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">候选人；竞争者；候选项；选项；名单；候选资格；候选人身份；提名</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">天候</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">てんこう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">天气；天候</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">程</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>程度；限度；距离；规定；量</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">テイ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ほど・-ほど</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">程度</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ていど</span><span class=\"k-wz\">程度；等级；标准；大约；左右</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">課程</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">かてい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">课程；课程体系</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">過程</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">かてい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">过程；进程；机制</span></li></ul></div></li>"]